@startuml
title TARS originale - Generazione di una spiegazione
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #526477
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F5F7FA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CCD5DF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EDF2F7
skinparam componentBorderColor #526477
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF2F7
skinparam classBorderColor #526477
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EDF2F7
skinparam participantBorderColor #526477

participant "VS Code" as seqVS
participant "explainCodeCommand" as seqCommand
participant "globalState" as seqState
participant "RAG" as seqRag
participant "agent / planner" as seqAgent
participant "ChatOpenAI" as seqChat
participant "OpenAI API" as seqAPI

note over seqVS,seqState
  Editor attivo; configurazione e profilo gia salvati.
  Percorso riuscito, senza risultato in cache.
end note
seqVS -> seqCommand : tars.explain-code
seqCommand -> seqState : get(tarsConfiguration), get(userMind)
seqState --> seqCommand : modello, chiave, profilo
seqCommand -> seqCommand : estrae codice e import
loop per ogni target
  seqCommand -> seqRag : retrieve(construct.name)
  seqRag --> seqCommand : documentazione
  seqCommand -> seqAgent : invoke(state)
  seqAgent -> seqChat : new / withStructuredOutput()
  seqAgent -> seqChat : chain.invoke()
  seqChat -> seqAPI : richiesta
  seqAPI --> seqChat : risposta
  seqChat --> seqAgent : results: [{text, description}]
  seqAgent -> seqAgent : syntaxCheckNode(state)
  seqAgent --> seqCommand : outputStructure
  seqCommand -> seqVS : decorateExplanation()
end
legend bottom
  agent e il grafo compilato; planner() e il suo nodo generativo.
  Prompt, cache e decorazioni sono sintetizzati; nessun ciclo di critica attivo.
endlegend
@enduml
